-This method is described in the unofficial source [S1, unofficial] by cianjinks, which implements a Sparse Voxel Octree traversal in C++. It is also referenced in [S2, unofficial] by saurlax for voxelization and hover interaction. The technique relies on fixed-point arithmetic principles adapted for floating-point ray tracing to maintain precision across octree levels.
